{"id":"Wcad222057df878d9397596c2","zh":"参数匹配","en":"","name":"参数匹配","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":"C01b7407b04d965c00d14","families":[],"definition_zh":"根据性能要求和参数间相互影响确定协调取值的过程。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于车辆—轨道及浮置板系统的协同设计，通过联合选择车辆、轨道或支承结构参数，确定满足耦合响应设计目标或响应限值要求的参数配置。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wcad222057df878d9397596c2","text":"参数匹配","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S811601ee8b7876832e45","source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"对于复杂的动力系统,系统属性即为众多系统部件参数匹配后的统一表征。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Scd6a11344967aa24d3f4","source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"动力激扰下,参数与参数匹配后引起的系统物理力学行为可通过此模型合理考虑。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sccff39a870dfb2b2fa22","source_id":"P137","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"减振垫和减振扣件虽能有效减振,但其低刚度特性会增大钢轨和道床板位移,影响车辆运行的平稳性和舒适性,因此,如何通过合理的参数匹配实现减振垫浮置板系统的低动力响应设计显得尤为重要。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2a7153299fa359fb1f64","source_id":"P137","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"目前针对市域铁路的参数匹配研究较少。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P117":{"id":"P117","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2019","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2019.05.022","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system"},"P137":{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"un